{"unit_id":"chinosk6__dsh-roleplay#feature-1","repo":"chinosk6/dsh-roleplay","commit":"b5646b4143ce987484fdbc896a19374944c3742e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-roleplay 的「角色扮演会话」功能：为所选角色注入人设和相关世界书上下文，并按设置决定是否自动配图。用户从 DSH 的角色扮演 preset 开始会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/agent.ts:200-223","client/index.tsx:63-79"]}
{"unit_id":"chinosk6__dsh-roleplay#feature-2","repo":"chinosk6/dsh-roleplay","commit":"b5646b4143ce987484fdbc896a19374944c3742e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-roleplay 的「角色卡创作」功能：通过独立 forge 模式访谈式创建角色卡，并可把生成头像关联到卡片。用户在 Character Forge preset 中描述灵感并按提示补充。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:55-69","client/index.tsx:63-79"]}
{"unit_id":"chinosk6__dsh-roleplay#feature-3","repo":"chinosk6/dsh-roleplay","commit":"b5646b4143ce987484fdbc896a19374944c3742e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-roleplay 的「卡片与世界书管理」功能：保存角色卡、头像及书籍条目，并支持会话绑定角色卡。用户在浏览器角色扮演面板管理卡片和绑定。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/service.ts:29-36","client/index.tsx:63-79"]}
{"unit_id":"chinosk6__dsh-roleplay#feature-4","repo":"chinosk6/dsh-roleplay","commit":"b5646b4143ce987484fdbc896a19374944c3742e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-roleplay 的「图片生成与参考图」功能：调用配置的图像后端生成插图，并可使用会话上传图片或角色头像作为参考。agent 工具调用 generate_image 触发生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/image-tool.ts:48-62","client/index.tsx:63-79"]}
{"unit_id":"chinosk6__dsh-roleplay#feature-5","repo":"chinosk6/dsh-roleplay","commit":"b5646b4143ce987484fdbc896a19374944c3742e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-roleplay 的「互动选项模式」功能：让角色回复以 2 到 8 个可点击选择收尾，便于选择下一步行动。用户在设置中启用 choiceMode。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/settings.ts:69-72","client/index.tsx:63-79"]}
